We can [Cmaj7] jump in the water and see what floats     [Cmaj7]-[C]   [Cmaj7]
[D] We've been saving for a rainy day                                  [D]-[Dsus2]   [D]-[Dsus2]
Let's [C] beat the storm and be on our way                         [Cmaj7]         [Cmaj7]

